{'symbol': 'PHM', 'date': '2022-11-28 09:00:00', 'title': 'LINCOLN PRAIRIE BY DEL WEBB CELEBRATES HIGHLY ANTICIPATED GRAND OPENING', 'text': "CHICAGO--( BUSINESS WIRE )--DEL WEBB, THE NATION'S LEADING BUILDER OF ACTIVE ADULT COMMUNITIES FOR THOSE 55 AND OLDER, ANNOUNCES THE GRAND OPENING OF LINCOLN PRAIRIE BY DEL WEBB – ITS FIRST NEW COMMUNITY IN THE GREATER CHICAGO AREA IN OVER 15 YEARS. LOCATED IN AURORA, THIS RESORT-STYLE COMMUNITY DEBUTED SIX FULLY FURNISHED MODEL HOMES AT A CELEBRATORY RIBBON CUTTING CEREMONY THIS MONTH."}